## 5. Build & Tooling

### ✅ Followed
- Standard Maven/Spring Boot project layout, dependencies declared cleanly, Lombok used consistently for boilerplate reduction.

### ❌ Not followed
`pom.xml` (`investor-portfolio-hexagonal/pom.xml`) has only the `spring-boot-maven-plugin`. None of the following present in the reference are configured:
- Checkstyle
- PMD / SpotBugs
- Error Prone + NullAway
- JaCoCo
- Spotless (formatting)
- OWASP dependency-check

Java 17 is used here vs Java 21 in `template-microservice` — not inherently wrong, but worth aligning if this is meant to become the team's shared baseline going forward.

### 🔧 Needs attention
- At minimum, add Checkstyle + JaCoCo to match the reference's non-negotiables before this pattern is copied to a third service.

