**Bottom line:** the team correctly followed the hexagonal layering and port/adapter naming pattern from `template-microservice`. Everything downstream of that — dependency injection discipline, error handling, validation, logging, automated testing, and build-quality gates — falls short of the established baseline. The highest-priority items are the zero test coverage on the business-logic layer and the deploy-blocking security/config issues; both should be resolved before this service goes further or is used as a template for other teams.
